## Run

Review `parameters.json`, then run from this directory:

```bash
bash run_md.sh
```

AMBER and cpptraj must be available on `PATH`. `pmemd.cuda` is used when present,
otherwise the script falls back to `pmemd` and then `sander`.
{% if system_type == "protein_ligand" and charge_method == "resp" %}
RESP preparation also requires Gaussian 16 (`g16`) on `PATH`.
{% endif %}

Outputs are written under `work/`; analysis tables are written under `work/analyse/`.
This generated workflow is a starting point for standard soluble proteins. It is not
validated for membranes, nucleic acids, metal centers, glycans, covalent ligands, or
non-standard residues.
